channel. Nobody else can use them, and you&#x27;re in control of how to present the output.</p><div class="ResourceCard-module-scss-module__q33Tuq__products text-caption"><span class="ResourceCard-module-scss-module__q33Tuq__productTag"><span class="ResourceCard-module-scss-module__q33Tuq__markupIcon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.9248 2.40039C12.8311 2.4005 14.5076 3.04387 15.71 4.22363C16.914 5.40516 17.5995 7.08267 17.5996 9.06641C17.5996 9.87158 17.3265 11.0383 16.7217 11.9619C16.1011 12.9095 15.0586 13.6849 13.584 13.3877C12.9405 13.2579 12.4881 12.8907 12.2148 12.3916C12.1862 12.3393 12.1602 12.2857 12.1357 12.2314C12.0316 12.3735 11.9261 12.5063 11.8125 12.625C11.2025 13.2622 10.4961 13.5332 9.82324 13.5879L9.82422 13.5889C9.24527 13.6424 8.41154 13.5126 7.70508 13.041C6.96416 12.5463 6.40048 11.6971 6.40039 10.4238C6.40039 8.18439 8.19441 6.4004 10.6924 6.40039C11.4959 6.40041 12.1822 6.70501 12.6475 6.98633C12.8833 7.12897 13.0725 7.2718 13.2041 7.37988C13.2702 7.43414 13.3223 7.48078 13.3594 7.51465C13.3729 7.52698 13.3841 7.53796 13.3936 7.54688C13.3944 7.54764 13.3956 7.54806 13.3965 7.54883L13.4033 7.55566C13.4087 7.56086 13.4135 7.56498 13.417 7.56836C13.4187 7.57004 13.4197 7.57203 13.4209 7.57324L13.4229 7.57422L13.4238 7.5752V7.57617C13.4289 7.58125 13.4326 7.58756 13.4375 7.59277C13.4557 7.6124 13.4729 7.63255 13.4883 7.6543C13.4986 7.66887 13.5077 7.68399 13.5166 7.69922C13.5266 7.71641 13.5357 7.73387 13.5439 7.75195C13.5517 7.76897 13.5584 7.78619 13.5645 7.80371C13.5715 7.82398 13.5781 7.84425 13.583 7.86523C13.5866 7.88074 13.5885 7.89642 13.5908 7.91211C13.5943 7.93508 13.5969 7.958 13.5977 7.98145C13.5982 7.99777 13.5975 8.01396 13.5967 8.03027C13.5956 8.05111 13.5941 8.07185 13.5908 8.09277C13.5879 8.11122 13.5837 8.12929 13.5791 8.14746C13.5756 8.16129 13.5739 8.1757 13.5693 8.18945C13.3261 8.91906 13.0634 9.95159 13.0693 10.8184C13.072