or people who work with Claude throughout the day and want longer, uninterrupted sessions. You get everything in Pro, plus more usage: choose from 5x or 20x the usage of Pro per 5-hour session. Max also gives you higher output limits. Both options are billed monthly. See the cards above for current pricing.\",\"eW5eoWkxy3\":\"Artifacts\",\"eW9hutaHeF\":\"Check the draft against leveling guide v4\",\"eYENP/pkgh\":\"Software Development\",\"eZPOl0kWMZ\":\"Read the deal thread, Jun 30 – Aug 14\",\"ede6BSFS4Y\":\"Scan your codebase for vulnerabilities, validate findings, and generate suggested patches.\",\"egHChszzD6\":\"{type} access form\",\"ejEGdx"])</script><script nonce="O2AiRF6Rt4k043IesqPpJQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"SUGs\":\"Home\",\"el7wVC1bkn\":\"Featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"emgl65lJkN\":\"Organization wide skills deployment\",\"epieNNdeXY\":\"Claude Code is moving our team up a level: we decide what needs to happen, and smooth the process so it can build and verify end-to-end. A big part of my job now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.\",\"euiA1H61OH\":\"Customers outside of Europe can follow this process to \u003ca\u003erequest a refund\u003c/a\u003e:\",\"eylXO8YdWn\":\"Build the slide, comps table behind it\",\"f/P3Iud8AH\":\"Max 20x\",\"f6NhKWst8e\":\"Other plugins\",\"fBG/GeW9Uc\":\"Cost\",\"fC/+2oE3HG\":\"Results for “{query}”\",\"fEE0vf8ygf\":\"Not included\",\"fGpRdLrMdV\":\"Does Claude Code work with the Claude desktop app?\",\"fIg106zNao\":\"slide\",\"fIxDjT+aMY\":\"Splitting decisions from action items first\",\"fJ79V5uNwz\":\"Yes. Max, Pro, Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Code on the Claude desktop app.\",\"fL3yWFg4Na\":\"Video player\",\"fPBr/eGp6u\":\"Document Processing \u0026 Extraction\",\"fVuTCs6dAD\":\"Related products\",\"fY8+6FRyY8\":\"Incognito chats\",\"fde27wEzOW\":\"Payment options\",\"filwqDWORF\":\"Read\",\"fio5opLcOZ\":\"Output\",\"fkihPk7bb3\":\"All partners\",\"flmC4r