ge at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"ijMdGR7OO4\":\"Cross-check 34 issues and 34 PRs\",\"ilVgAypzhr\":\"Claude Cowork is now just Claude.\",\"inUkccnHv6\":\"Set preferences that apply across every conversation.\",\"isGKnzG5uL\":\"Documentation\",\"it6Ligcq3B\":\"Input\",\"iuSNLHoe8Z\":\"Get a comprehensive university‐wide plan for an institution, including its students, faculty, and staff.\",\"iun6grW2C+\":\"Claude Consumption / FinOps Optimisation\",\"iwE5pm/oXq\":\"Contract redline\",\"ize18jQXCF\":\"Now standing: Mondays before staff meeting\",\"j/NXahNfg2\":\"Briefs\",\"j2hlcpE79k\":\"Browser use\",\"jB1nSrwP8X\":\"{count, plural, one {# webinar} other {# webinars}}\",\"jCxscTUx/w\":\"Watch the recording\",\"jI62MY64Qn\":\"Other\",\"jKKg2of6uk\":\"Clear all filters\",\"jLXY9o1l5R\":\"Customer success support at certain spend thresholds\",\"jSd3FgIcuH\":\"Step-by-step walkthroughs and practical playbooks for getting the most out of Claude.\",\"jWt3I/bVbN\":\"Save 50% with batch processing. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"jcwE2sEK9f\":\"Connects with your favorite command line tools\",\"jewMdfuvaC\":\"{variant, select, brief {Next brief} report {Next report} other {Next guide}}\",\"jfCrPjcoTy\":\"Alphabetically (Z to A)\",\"jgPXwd1foX\":\"Product:\",\"jhr0P2VITB\":\"Managed AI Operations\",\"jm/spnRSn+\":\"Reset\",\"js+IVaPpb9\":\"Chapter {number}\",\"jsHFp13ghq\":\"Demos, talks, and tutorials from the teams building and using Claude.\",\"jtygmIHCQ1\":\"Education\",\"jvODrZtR+p\":\"Select\",\"jw+K5d+CdN\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at standard API pricing.\",\"jw7DDs8FJv\":\"Office Locations (On-Site Services)\",\"jx7Hn3QkH8\":\"Article\",\"k2veDAJW1p\":\"Write\",\"k4+9FsLhU8\":\"On consumption-based plans.\",\"k8cDUYjZKq\":\"Add to Claude\",\"kBJUtE9oHc\":\"Video\",\"kBa7elYtHL\":\"Earnings comps\",\"kFe6I3hifr\":\"Close capabilities\",\"kM+C0c9vMj\":\"Read what changed\",\"kMJ7N+HH1m\":\"Includes Claude Design\",\"kVrpkF04ro\":\"Webinars\",\"kdUZJIKMMe\":\"Global (any region)\",\"kfiCd53EoX\":\"stories\",\"kh/sk1M1PF\":\"Here are this month’s regional actuals exports. Reconcile them into one summary, flag any variances against budget, and note anything that doesn’t tie out.\",\"khjKGjoVqR\":\"View source\",\"kkjl2vQekD\":\"Max\",\"kkm29b5t2g\":\"Connectors, plugins and API integrations\",\"kmWDaKdQa7\":\"Downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing period, and your chats, projects, and files stay with your account whichever plan you're on.\",\"krcRxpVfJ7\":\"Travel \u0026 Hospitality\",\"ktRQ8OmQ1C\":\"If you're in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom, and within your 14-day withdrawal period, you can request a refund directly in the app.\",\"kvOMtBRD9I\":\"Credit card\",\"kyuy4QAduP\":\"The board deck five. Whatever tier they push hardest.\",\"kzQgd/+809\":\"Product overview\",\"l/bdoV65Uq\":\"Close (Esc)\",\"l0cx8sfvyN\":\"Consultation\",\"l6yCDglZqT\":\"Continue with email\",\"lBAoMMkYNE\":\"Horizontal / Cross-industry\",\"lDLuhpAPUD\":\"Opus\",\"lN0CJi045d\":\"Permissions control\",\"lRdUjp0Vbo\":\"Files and folders\",\"lVREK+O2A7\":\"Claude Security (beta)\",\"lXFbqgnTzj\":\"Hand off and schedule tasks\",\"lbr3Lq2Lnm\":\"Copy link\",\"lbtOA3j+V3\":\"Require that any accounts using your domain migrate to your organization\",\"lcRZ9HSjkB\":\"Administrative tools for Team and Enterprise\",\"lcjzsP/DJa\":\"Per month with annual subscription discount (\u003cannual\u003e$200\u003c/annual\u003e billed up front). \u003cmonthly\u003e$20\u003c/monthly\u003e if billed monthly.\",\"lgU1HeQGw4\":\"Global Premier\",\"lh0xe+kwtT\":\"Works with\",\"ll/ufR0/ED\":\"Trending\",\"lpFUMU324g\":\"Compliance API for observability and monitoring\",\"lu3AvZt"])</script><script nonce="O2AiRF6Rt4k043IesqPpJQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"5aS\":\"Research, benchmarks, and analysis on how AI is changing the way organizations build, plan, and operate.\",\"ludPcY9ukn\":\"Compare features across plans\",\"lw49qiF68V\":\"Let Claude write and run code to build files like spreadsheets, presentations, and docs for you.\",\"m0TzBiIhvZ\":\"Central billing and administration\",\"m7oyS564FD\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro or Max plan, a Team or Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account. Download Claude Code and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"m7v1ahj/te\":\"Native extensions for VS Code (+ Cursor, Devin Desktop) and JetBrains IDEs.\",\"mABpZRe7C5\":\"The developer newsletter\",\"mENE7vJhVQ\":\"Extended thinking for complex work\",\"mG4nNtNqKg\":\"Updated {date}\",\"mIV5za3QLY\":\"Draft 11 field updates, nothing saved\",\"mKkfuHn2hN\":\"More information\",\"mVaGK86OHA\":\"From {tool}\",\"mVkTZZgH2a\":\"Plugin\",\"mWIVle/RBJ\":\"Date\",\"mWPRGNJ4Uw\":\"Convert EMEA at the July average, 1.088\",\"mWVI74nTV2\":\"Ask and artifact\",\"meOv8JJVYB\":\"Chat with buying specialist\",\"mfFBo/0Z21\":\"Canceling doesn't delete your data. Your chats, projects, and files stay with your account, though some features aren't available on the Free plan. For Pro and Max, your account moves to the Free plan once the period ends. For step-by-step help, see \u003ca\u003ehow to cancel a Pro or Max plan\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003ecancel a Team plan\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"mnJYBQZwb4\":\"Voice\",\"mofX8KnW9/\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. \u003ca\u003eSee full system requirements\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"mscD97HgEg\":\"Managed / Recurring\",\"mwHr7Se8D1\":\"Access to Claude’s latest models for reasoning, coding, and writing.\",\"mxnaO8gi08\":\"Claude lives inside Chrome, ready wherever you browse.\",\"myTIbit5tv\":\"Select partners\",\"mynHYVUSOV\":\"Nordics\",\"n469UeWQIf\":\"Download for ChromeOS\",\"n5D/KuWRGi\":\"Communication\",\"n9S67YubfC\":\"Choose the Claude plan that fits how you solve problems. Free, Pro, Max, Team, and Enterprise tiers, plus API pricing for developers.\",\"nEA1MxORgH\":\"For {role}\",\"nL8xcmnbjm\":\"Write the digest, what-to-watch first\",\"nOk9mhxGpU\":\"List\",\"nPtgyxpUd0\":\"How do I cancel my Claude subscription?\",\"nScLeP89Ov\":\"Migrate code\",\"nTMLK2RYtE\":\"Deployment Surface\",\"nUT0LvZVOx\":\"Tools\",\"nYokoOMWQh\":\"See solution\",\"nb4F4k82C7\":\"Search {text}\",\"njpnaOi5/X\":\"Resume video\",\"noi6IWMyXA\":\"Project / Program\",\"npxjiYSnPH\":\"v3. Contractors moved to the ops budget.\",\"nx8x3WZ4/G\":\"enterprise security\",\"o+ToCFnM8m\":\"Turn on permissions settings so Claude shows its plan and waits for your approval. Redirect or stop anytime.\",\"o/AcDuEdCh\":\"Create what’s exciting. Maintain what’s essential.\",\"o4eiiyba8k\":\"Compare against Q1\",\"oEZ3tJt0N9\":\"Here’s a list of flagged sites. Visit each one, take a screenshot, and triage it against our trademark enforcement playbook. Rank them by priority.\",\"oFLooU1/QL\":\"{minutes} min remaining\",\"oGju2hB9//\":\"Compliance API\",\"oJiyzDUmhQ\":\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\",\"oKdO3Ime5c\":\"Build a social set for the Fall Readout using our brand guidelines. Three 4:5 posts — a stat, a headline, and a trend — as one proof sheet.\",\"oNxIDnOk31\":\"Post the roll-up in-channel\",\"oUWADlOjJt\":\"No\",\"oZA/6fiLF8\":\"Partner tier\",\"odMy5ERU7S\":\"Quick answers or long tasks\",\"ohjvu+C87x\":\"Active users\",\"omjuNlvXVf\":\"Think fast,{br}build faster\",\"onyxL5iLxe\":\"{count, plural, other {# more}}\",\"onz7SZxGnk\":\"Build Prototype / POC\",\"otTZisSg5A\":\"If you subscribed through the App Store or Google Play, cancel from that app under Billing \u003e Manage subscription, or directly in your \u003ca\u003eApple\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003eGoogle Play\u003c/b\u003e account.\",\"ox9wXewvNY\":\"Check the week’s meetings, next team sync Thursday\",\"p556q3uvbn\":\"Copied\",\"p7f+VL1U+Y\":\"Swipe to see more\",\"pCl8kahPwa\":\"Next testimonials\",\"pCyFJadqy/\":\"Simon Last, Co-founder\",\"pFZfPaYqm/\":\"n/a\",\"pGLybCbau7\":\"New connectors\",\"pJx1IlMdHc\":\"Each entry is "])</script><script nonce="O2AiRF6Rt4k043IesqPpJQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"a fixed snapshot of prices effective on the date shown.\",\"pK+9X32ExT\":\"Access tools\",\"pQmvynhfYT\":\"“\",\"pWPK7z+xaP\":\"{label} — steps\",\"pZ4CtGSlwT\":\"Try Claude\",\"pZf04BdODJ\":\"If you signed up on the web or the desktop app, go to \u003ca\u003eSettings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e and click Cancel.\",\"peouYNi1Sg\":\"Next featured resource\",\"phAZoj/lCl\":\"Collection\",\"pun/KVSUTp\":\"No connectors for those filters\",\"pwjQafECwL\":\"Powered by Claude\",\"pxF+t0PUQJ\":\"Popular\",\"qANDCowpHs\":\"Knowledge Retrieval \u0026 Enterprise Search\",\"qSEmqaxK/a\":\"Download desktop app\",\"qWb1zA13jM\":\"Rank by risk, critical first\",\"qank7+0V6w\":\"Continue with SSO\",\"qavaSjp85p\":\"Includes Claude Code\",\"qcDygS25FQ\":\"Brief\",\"qhHpS4CiBR\":\"Get Enterprise plan\",\"qoMwDfFqSS\":\"Post the running list to #product-team\",\"qqW8aMzEzp\":\"Training Package\",\"qsluU7sYQR\":\"Company size:\",\"r/7WfhmG3M\":\"Matching five transcripts to three open opportunities\",\"r/R93LFqEp\":\"Connectors and plugins\",\"r8XsCUEvou\":\"Connector\",\"rClne6thca\":\"Check this job description against our leveling guide. Give me back an edited version and an interview kit.\",\"rCwYJ1AtP0\":\"financial services\",\"rFNJ5GIHwJ\":\"The challenge\",\"rIAJlEKVw9\":\"Added\",\"rNKFHm2P6a\":\"Research case law on this issue in our jurisdiction. Verify citations against CourtListener, summarize the controlling precedent, and draft a memo on how it applies to our matter.\",\"rUSV9GH+x6\":\"Opt-out\",\"raYGLW8PVB\":\"Date\",\"rbrahOGMC3\":\"Close\",\"rfycQ8j6IA\":\"Use case details\",\"riqC8uz